From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:54:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Measure stateless Worker isolate lock hold time

Track bounded wall-time windows on the outer JSG lock and publish each loaded stateless isolate's reading in the existing lifecycle snapshot.

